<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>Is that so? I think that is all right as well.<PG>
If you should change your mind, I will take the steps to unlock the second arc by the same operation as before.<PG>
However, the deadline is until the first scenario is finished. Please take care.<PG>
Forgive me, but I will close this world once, so may I ask you to start it up again?<PG>
Then, I shall take my leave.<PG>
{MESOFF "-1"}
{DELETECG "プレート" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
